              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakala ni furaha kulu sana hiko Jerusalemu, kpwa mana hangu siku za Selemani mfalume wa Iziraeli mwana wa Daudi, kala takudzangbwehendeka dzambo dza hiro hiko Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
